    <string name="shield_explainer">The Shield blocks trackers and ads by refusing their domain lookups (DNS). It runs entirely on this phone as a local VPN: your traffic is not sent to SpirOS or any proxy.</string>
    <string name="shield_space">Protect the isolated space</string>
    <string name="shield_space_desc">Runs as the always-on VPN of the space, covering every app inside it. No system prompt is needed.</string>
    <string name="shield_google_off">Disable Google services in the space</string>
    <string name="shield_google_off_desc">Hides Google Play Services and the Play Store inside the space. Some apps need them for notifications or sign-in.</string>
    <string name="shield_phone">Protect the main phone</string>
    <string name="shield_phone_desc">Android will ask you once to allow the VPN. Only one VPN can be active at a time.</string>
