    <string name="other_explainer">Android allows only one work profile, and only the app that created it (or you, in system Settings) can delete or manage it. SpirOS cannot take it over, but it can show what it is, open its apps, and take you to where it is removed. Once it is gone, come back here and the Create button will appear.</string>
