    <string name="dock_linux">Linux</string>
    <string name="linux_title">Linux desktop</string>
    <string name="linux_intro">A full Debian Linux with the Xfce desktop, running directly on your phone\'s processor (no emulation), inside SpirOS\'s private storage. Use it like a computer: files, terminal, Python, and later AI models and MT5 for desktop.</string>
    <string name="linux_needs_edition">The fast Linux desktop needs the \"SpirOS Linux\" edition. Android only lets apps built for Android 9 run Linux programs from their storage (like Termux), so it is a separate app that installs next to SpirOS. The main SpirOS keeps all of Android\'s protections.</string>
    <string name="linux_get_edition">Download SpirOS Linux</string>
    <string name="linux_unsupported">This phone\'s processor or this build does not support the Linux desktop.</string>
    <string name="linux_install_desc">Downloads Debian + Xfce (about 300 MB, around 1.2 GB once installed) from the SpirOS project, checks its fingerprint (SHA-256) and installs it privately inside the app.</string>
    <string name="linux_install">Download and install Linux</string>
