    <string name="perf_freeze">Freeze Linux in the background</string>
    <string name="perf_freeze_desc">Linux, the AI and the Lab use no CPU while SpirOS is closed, and continue instantly when you return. Turn off to keep MT5 or long jobs running.</string>
